=== ISSUE ===
Title: lookup_standard_tablebase: dtc is a boolean, but the tablebase only accepts never/auxiliary/always

`lookup_standard_tablebase` sends `dtc=true` or `dtc=false`. The Lichess API spec (https://github.com/lichess-org/api/blob/906d1a6e93ca1ba4b65c9decb3077f2431c6d55a/doc/specs/lichess-api.yaml, `GET /standard`) defines `dtc` as an enum: `never`, `auxiliary` (the default), `always`.

Live, on tablebase.lichess.org: `dtc=true` and `dtc=false` both return 400; `never`, `auxiliary` and `always` all return 200.

